STAT(1)                     User Commands

NAME
    stat - print file attributes

SYNOPSIS
    stat [-L] file...

DESCRIPTION
    stat prints the size, the block count and block size, the type, the
    device and inode numbers, the link count and the permission bits of
    each file. A symbolic link is reported itself, with the type symbolic
    link, the length of its target as the size and "-> target" after the
    name. -L reports the file the link leads to instead.

SEE ALSO
    ls(1), readlink(1)
